  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u79c5aad8\" id=\"u79c5aad8\"><span data-lake-id=\"uff0e601d\" id=\"uff0e601d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\">这里也算是项目的细节，主要是涉及到三个工具类的应用。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"cONyk\" id=\"cONyk\"><span data-lake-id=\"u69250cbe\" id=\"u69250cbe\">日志系统</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u5238056a\" id=\"u5238056a\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue1ed1e8a\" id=\"ue1ed1e8a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">muduo的日志库分采用前后端分离。产生日志的线程都可以称作前端。有一个线程专门负责把前端的日志写入文件，这个线程就称为后端。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uac8b5e43\" id=\"uac8b5e43\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6661d125\" id=\"u6661d125\">muduo日志库采用双缓冲技术</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8ff35647\" id=\"u8ff35647\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">，所谓双缓冲技术就是前后端各有一个（其实是各有两个）大小为4MB的Buffer，之所以各有一个Buffer，是为了当前端Buffer写满了之后，后端空闲的Buffer能够立刻和前端的Buffer互换，互换完成后就可以释放锁，让前端继续向互换后的Buffer中写入日志，而不必等待后端把日志全部写入文件后再释放锁，大大减小了锁的粒度，这也是muduo异步日志高效的关键原因之一。（详细请看陈硕的书P114，5.3节）</span></p><blockquote data-lake-id=\"u60794ac2\" id=\"u60794ac2\" class=\"lake-alert lake-alert-tips\"><p data-lake-id=\"uf38596fc\" id=\"uf38596fc\"><span data-lake-id=\"uebb0e97a\" id=\"uebb0e97a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">需要说明的是：</span></p><ul list=\"ue8211f2e\"><li fid=\"u7a0c16bb\" data-lake-id=\"udae2b057\" id=\"udae2b057\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue7d3efba\" id=\"ue7d3efba\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">muduo前后端各有两个大小为4MB的Buffer，下图为了方面明白异步日志的思想，简化为前后端各自只有一个Buffer</span></li><li fid=\"u7a0c16bb\" data-lake-id=\"u0857141f\" id=\"u0857141f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4519fae8\" id=\"u4519fae8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">这里的Buffer不是Buffer.h中定义的Buffer，而是FixedBuffer.h中定义的，可以理解为一个有4MB</span></li><li fid=\"u7a0c16bb\" data-lake-id=\"u2ea1209c\" id=\"u2ea1209c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6ce47284\" id=\"u6ce47284\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">大小的字符数组</span></li></ul></blockquote><p data-lake-id=\"u7f8f4ad1\" id=\"u7f8f4ad1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u44f1c088\" id=\"u44f1c088\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">现在的关键是，前后端的Buffer什么时候互换呢？</span></p><ul list=\"u1c80089f\"><li fid=\"uf2f6cd01\" data-lake-id=\"u484bb521\" id=\"u484bb521\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6aea6014\" id=\"u6aea6014\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">第一种情况：前端Buffer写满了，就会唤醒后台线程互换Buffer，并把Buffer中的日志写入文件</span></li><li fid=\"uf2f6cd01\" data-lake-id=\"u8d70bf9b\" id=\"u8d70bf9b\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubd6aae7d\" id=\"ubd6aae7d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">第二种情况：</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud7ee657c\" id=\"ud7ee657c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">为了及时把前端Buffer中的日志写入文件，日志库也会每3秒执行一次交换Buffer的操作</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3e87ab35\" id=\"u3e87ab35\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">。(面试官可能会问你为什么要3秒交换一次Buffer)</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"ue027d1de\" id=\"ue027d1de\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua80fea83\" id=\"ua80fea83\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">下图就以第二种情况为例，展示日志库双缓冲原理。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9843b50f\" id=\"u9843b50f\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F47188040%2F1736303035984-d376bf42-89f9-4e2c-afa6-933463d893b6.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u5df5c4a2-b93b-4f7a-a980-69fe6c614b2%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u5e7b1ad4-b432-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1408%2C%22originHeight%22%3A1394%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22errorMessage%22%3A%22unknown%20error%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3Anull%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f5f2f1%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zJM7b%22%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u99504b51\" id=\"u99504b51\"><span data-lake-id=\"u62ecd490\" id=\"u62ecd490\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"><br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u19ab1430\" id=\"u19ab1430\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">在0~3秒之间，当前端的线程调用了</span><code data-lake-id=\"u8dbccf5a\" id=\"u8dbccf5a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u58dd1ab0\" id=\"u58dd1ab0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">LOG_INFO &lt;&lt; 日志信息;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uba2e8b93\" id=\"uba2e8b93\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">，会开辟一个4KB大小的空间，用于存储“日志信息”，当该语句执行结束时，就已经把日志信息都存储到前端的Buffer（黄色Buffer）中，同时析构自己刚开辟的4KB的空间。</span><span data-lake-id=\"u3bfe1a1e\" id=\"u3bfe1a1e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"><br /><br /></span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5953e3a6\" id=\"u5953e3a6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0f9d839b\" id=\"u0f9d839b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">在3秒之后，后端线程被唤醒，为了让前端阻塞时间更短，后端把自己的红色Buffer和前端的黄色Buffer互换，然后就可以释放锁，这样前端又能及时的向红色Buffer中写入新的日志信息。后端线程也可以把来自前端的黄色Buffer中的数据写入文件。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"stVlf\" id=\"stVlf\"><span data-lake-id=\"u04e0b5e6\" id=\"u04e0b5e6\">异步日志流程</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u3aceefd5\" id=\"u3aceefd5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9b1d98c3\" id=\"u9b1d98c3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">异步日志前端产生日志和同步是一致的，下面主要说明异步情况下，</span><code data-lake-id=\"ue05f2d08\" id=\"ue05f2d08\"><span data-lake-id=\"u69cda770\" id=\"u69cda770\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">LogStream::buffer_</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uddf1e9df\" id=\"uddf1e9df\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">中的数据是怎么输出到指定位置的。由于异步日志不是默认的方式，需要自行开启，下面就从开启异步日志开始讲解。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"YL97Z\" id=\"YL97Z\"><span data-lake-id=\"uab9d521a\" id=\"uab9d521a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">把日志写入缓冲区</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ubd4084bc\" id=\"ubd4084bc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u13ceba75\" id=\"u13ceba75\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">经过同步日志分析，我们直到</span><code data-lake-id=\"ua35cf321\" id=\"ua35cf321\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3bd10093\" id=\"u3bd10093\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">LOG_INFO &lt;&lt; data</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u057cc863\" id=\"u057cc863\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">执行完成时，就会调用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u36594aee\" id=\"u36594aee\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf8ba24a5\" id=\"uf8ba24a5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">asyncOutput</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u2154380d\" id=\"u2154380d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">，接下来我们看一下日志信息是怎么写到用户自己定义的缓冲区的（即</span><code data-lake-id=\"u7fb33b5b\" id=\"u7fb33b5b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u77fe0b99\" id=\"u77fe0b99\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">g_asyncLog-&gt;append(msg, len);</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf6f70d5f\" id=\"uf6f70d5f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">做了什么事）：</span><span data-lake-id=\"u0858fa33\" id=\"u0858fa33\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"><br /></span><code data-lake-id=\"u4459a869\" id=\"u4459a869\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0909d75a\" id=\"u0909d75a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">AsyncLogging::append</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u59b6aeaa\" id=\"u59b6aeaa\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">函数基本原理是：先将日志信息存储到用户自己开辟的大缓冲区，当缓冲区写满后，通知后台线程把缓冲区的数据写入文件。</span><code data-lake-id=\"uac9aa9d7\" id=\"uac9aa9d7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6c2dbe41\" id=\"u6c2dbe41\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">apend</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u2389f869\" id=\"u2389f869\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">代码如下：注意</span><code data-lake-id=\"ua7a9d1d9\" id=\"ua7a9d1d9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufcc432da\" id=\"ufcc432da\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">currentBuffer_</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u4fd82103\" id=\"u4fd82103\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">有4M大小，之所以很大，是为了多积累一些日志信息，然后一并交给后端写入文件，避免频繁通知后台写文件。另外，</span><code data-lake-id=\"uba16aaf7\" id=\"uba16aaf7\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf5e7bdc5\" id=\"uf5e7bdc5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">currentBuffer_-&gt;append()</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uac4c042d\" id=\"uac4c042d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">是单纯的把日志信息写入</span><code data-lake-id=\"u69eb3d7b\" id=\"u69eb3d7b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u11f366e7\" id=\"u11f366e7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">currentBuffer_</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u1bc27e1a\" id=\"u1bc27e1a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">中，而不是像</span><code data-lake-id=\"u8fada8ff\" id=\"u8fada8ff\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0f699911\" id=\"u0f699911\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">LogFile</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"udadbf289\" id=\"udadbf289\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">的</span><code data-lake-id=\"u0299aa66\" id=\"u0299aa66\"><span data-lake-id=\"u10f0c6a5\" id=\"u10f0c6a5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">apend()</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ue47cae39\" id=\"ue47cae39\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">是将数据写入文件中。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22cpp%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F%2F%20%E5%89%8D%E7%AB%AF%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%E5%BC%80%E5%90%AF%E5%BC%82%E6%AD%A5%E6%97%A5%E5%BF%97%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%9D%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%B1%E4%BC%9A%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AA%EF%BC%8C%E6%8A%8A%E6%97%A5%E5%BF%97%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E5%86%99%E5%85%A5currentBuffer_%E4%B8%AD%5Cnvoid%20AsyncLogging%3A%3Aappend(const%20char*%20logline%2C%20int%20len)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20apend%E4%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E5%A4%9A%E4%B8%AA%E7%BA%BF%E7%A8%8B%E4%B8%AD%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%9F%E5%B0%B1%E6%98%AF%E5%A4%9A%E4%B8%AA%E7%BA%BF%E7%A8%8B%E4%BC%9A%E5%90%8C%E6%97%B6%E5%83%8FcurrentBuffer_%E4%B8%AD%E5%86%99%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%A0%E6%AD%A4%E8%A6%81%E5%8A%A0%E9%94%81%5Cn%20%20%20%20std%3A%3Alock_guard%3Cstd%3A%3Amutex%3E%20lock(mutex_)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E7%BC%93%E5%86%B2%E5%8C%BA%E5%89%A9%E4%BD%99%E7%A9%BA%E9%97%B4%E8%B6%B3%E5%A4%9F%E5%88%99%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%86%99%E5%85%A5%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20(currentBuffer_-%3Eavail()%20%3E%20len)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20currentBuffer_-%3Eappend(logline%2C%20len)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20else%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%BD%93%E5%89%8D%E7%BC%93%E5%86%B2%E5%8C%BA%E7%A9%BA%E9%97%B4%E4%B8%8D%E5%A4%9F%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%86%E6%96%B0%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E5%86%99%E5%85%A5%E5%A4%87%E7%94%A8%E7%BC%93%E5%86%B2%E5%8C%BA%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%B0%86%E5%86%99%E6%BB%A1%E7%9A%84currentBuffer_%E8%A3%85%E5%85%A5vector%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E5%8D%B3buffers_%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8FcurrentBuffer_%E6%98%AF%E7%8B%AC%E5%8D%A0%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%EF%BC%8C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20move%E5%90%8E%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E5%B0%B1%E6%8C%87%E5%90%91%E4%BA%86nullptr%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20buffers_.push_back(std%3A%3Amove(currentBuffer_))%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20nextBuffer_%E4%B8%8D%E7%A9%BA%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8EnextBuffer_%E6%8C%87%E5%90%91%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E8%BF%98%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E8%A2%ABcurrentBuffer_%E6%8A%A2%E8%B5%B0%EF%BC%8C%E4%B9%9F%E5%B0%B1%E6%98%AF%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20nextBuffer_%E8%BF%98%E6%B2%A1%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20if%20(nextBuffer_)%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E6%8A%8AnextBuffer_%E6%8C%87%E5%90%91%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%9F%E4%BA%A4%E7%BB%99currentBuffer_%EF%BC%8CnextBuffer_%E4%B9%9F%E8%A2%AB%E7%BD%AE%E7%A9%BA%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20currentBuffer_%20%3D%20std%3A%3Amove(nextBuffer_)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7D%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20else%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%A4%87%E7%94%A8%E7%BC%93%E5%86%B2%E5%8C%BA%E4%B9%9F%E4%B8%8D%E5%A4%9F%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BC%93%E5%86%B2%E5%8C%BA%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%99%E7%A7%8D%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E5%BE%88%E5%B0%91%E8%A7%81%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20currentBuffer_.reset(new%20Buffer)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20currentBuffer_-%3Eappend(logline%2C%20len)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%94%A4%E9%86%92%E5%86%99%E5%85%A5%E7%A3%81%E7%9B%98%E5%BE%97%E5%90%8E%E7%AB%AF%E7%BA%BF%E7%A8%8B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20cond_.notify_one()%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qNopn%22%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"NLO1m\" id=\"NLO1m\"><span data-lake-id=\"u47a3566f\" id=\"u47a3566f\">Buffer缓冲区</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u3ad31446\" id=\"u3ad31446\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub975c515\" id=\"ub975c515\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">Buffer内部是个std::vector，前8个字节预留着用于记录数据长度，readIndex指向可读取数据的初始位置，writerIndex指向空闲区的起始位置。下图展示了Buffer初始状态、写入部分数据和读取部分数据的情况。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub684e1bb\" id=\"ub684e1bb\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fapi%2Ffiletransfer%2Fimages%3Furl%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fcode-thinking-1253855093.file.myqcloud.com%252Fpics%252F20240730194348.png%26sign%3D7fa75345a3e1230ed3b699cd41d810f897e7cfb429719617a04163343392324a%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A876%2C%22originHeight%22%3A748%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22BzePP%22%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub8f08a4a\" id=\"ub8f08a4a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u95b3c886\" id=\"u95b3c886\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">在上图的基础上，如果接下来要继续写入大于&quot;size减writerIndex&quot;的数据怎么办？（见Buffer::makeSpace函数）</span></p><ol list=\"u6c1e8207\"><li fid=\"u661d2a5e\" data-lake-id=\"u5a65a849\" id=\"u5a65a849\"><span data-lake-id=\"u26f792b9\" id=\"u26f792b9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">如果要写入的数据只比&quot;空闲区②&quot;大，但是比“①+②”小，此时可以把未读取的数据往前挪，剩余的控件就足够写下要写的数据了。</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"uacfff3c7\" id=\"uacfff3c7\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F47188040%2F1736304620334-42717ace-9981-4a7f-8f3e-b6f988169fd4.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u9fa0cf14-ce7d-432f-8d49-ace2296ecbb%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u5e7b1ad4-b432-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A890%2C%22originHeight%22%3A756%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22errorMessage%22%3A%22unknown%20error%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3Anull%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f1f0ed%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zR4ph%22%7D\"></card></p><ol list=\"u6c1e8207\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"u661d2a5e\" data-lake-id=\"u7ad676ae\" id=\"u7ad676ae\"><span data-lake-id=\"u41ea454e\" id=\"u41ea454e\">如果要写入的数据大于“①+②”，则对Buffer进行扩容，扩容至刚好可以容纳需要写入的数据。</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"ued23e4b5\" id=\"ued23e4b5\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"uee30f23d\" id=\"uee30f23d\">在代码中都会先将剩余未读取的的数据移到前面，空闲1和2的空间连续在一起后进行扩容。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8590e81f\" id=\"u8590e81f\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F47188040%2F1736304679709-7b565b7e-2118-4a33-b6fd-a21ca8fb1caa.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ub2a6b062-c3bb-48c4-ac33-cc4b9edd3dd%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u5e7b1ad4-b432-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A968%2C%22originHeight%22%3A772%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22errorMessage%22%3A%22unknown%20error%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3Anull%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f3f2f0%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AMiUm%22%7D\"></card></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"eM1KP\" id=\"eM1KP\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6b9cd5b2\" id=\"u6b9cd5b2\">把socket上的数据写入Input Buffer</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ud5047886\" id=\"ud5047886\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucb754e25\" id=\"ucb754e25\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">当socket上有数据可读时，会调用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u954d537f\" id=\"u954d537f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4c990539\" id=\"u4c990539\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">TcpConnection::handleRead</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u0aa9cf26\" id=\"u0aa9cf26\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">函数，在该函数中，inputBuffer_会调用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u38cf9f7e\" id=\"u38cf9f7e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3c241684\" id=\"u3c241684\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">Buffer::readFd</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u845460c9\" id=\"u845460c9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">函数，把socket上的数据写入inputBuffer_中，核心代码如下：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22cpp%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22void%20TcpConnection%3A%3AhandleRead(Timestamp%20receiveTime)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20ssize_t%20n%20%3D%20inputBuffer_.readFd(channel_-%3Efd()%2C%20%26savedErrno)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20(n%20%3E%200)%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E4%BB%8Efd%E8%AF%BB%E5%88%B0%E4%BA%86%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E4%B8%94%E6%94%BE%E5%9C%A8%E4%BA%86inputBuffer_%E4%B8%8A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E5%B7%B2%E5%BB%BA%E7%AB%8B%E8%BF%9E%E6%8E%A5%E7%9A%84%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E6%9C%89%E5%8F%AF%E8%AF%BB%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E4%BA%86%20%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E4%BC%A0%E5%85%A5%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9E%E8%B0%83%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9ConMessage%20shared_from_this%E5%B0%B1%E6%98%AF%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E4%BA%86TcpConnection%E7%9A%84%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20messageCallback_(shared_from_this()%2C%20%26inputBuffer_%2C%20receiveTime)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnssize_t%20Buffer%3A%3AreadFd(int%20fd%2C%20int%20*saveErrno)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E6%A0%88%E9%A2%9D%E5%A4%96%E7%A9%BA%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E4%BB%8E%E5%A5%97%E6%8E%A5%E5%AD%97%E5%BE%80%E5%87%BA%E8%AF%BB%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%BD%93buffer_%E6%9A%82%E6%97%B6%E4%B8%8D%E5%A4%9F%E7%94%A8%E6%97%B6%E6%9A%82%E5%AD%98%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%8C%E5%BE%85buffer_%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%E8%B6%B3%E5%A4%9F%E7%A9%BA%E9%97%B4%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%9C%A8%E6%8A%8A%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E4%BA%A4%E6%8D%A2%E7%BB%99buffer_%E3%80%82%5Cn%20%20%20%20char%20extrabuf%5B65536%5D%20%3D%20%7B0%7D%3B%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20